WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:05.209
I knew I wanted to go into a college
that would be spiritually edifying,

00:00:05.209 --> 00:00:09.260
a place that would be not safe for my faith,

00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:14.380
but a safe place to grow in my
faith, and I've certainly found that at Hillsdale.

